
From: OpenWrt XMC Support
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: add XMC XM25QH32D support

Add support for XMC XM25QH32D 32-Mbit SPI NOR flash.
JEDEC ID: 0x204016
Capacity: 4 MiB
Sector size: 64 KiB

---
diff --git a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
@@ -1,1 +1,2 @@
 	{ "XM25QH128A", INFO(0x207018, 0, 64 * 1024, 256, SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ | SPI_NOR_QUAD_READ) },
+	{ "XM25QH32D", INFO(0x204016, 0, 64 * 1024, 64, SECT_4K) },
